Z||000000||GT Bastard||03-02-2000||08:05 PM||||So it was my day off, and I was minding my own business when I came to rest at a nearly deserted 4-way intersection next to the interstate.  Out of the blue, some older fellow pulls up next to me in a newish Dodge Dakota with a V8 badge on the fender.  I glance over at him and he just scowls back at me like he can't stand my blue hair and hates my plastic car. I couldn't tell if he was trying to provoke a race because my stereo was blaring 'Pennyroyal Tea' by Nirvana(I know Kurt is dead but I still like them!)  Anyhow, I thought nothing of his rude attitude towards me and slowly took off when the light turned green.  All of a sudden I hear him rev the living crap out of his truck and then I assumed that he dropped the clutch or something because he came up fast as hell.  He was probably about 2 Fiero-lengths behind me when I realized he was going to get crazy and I smashed the petal to the floor.  We ended up neck and neck until the top of first gear, and then I was able to walk away from him pretty easily.  What a crazy bastard!  I gave him the thumbs-up as I slowed down, but he just did a "ricer blow-by" instead.  Maybe someday I'll tell you guys I raced a real sports car! hehe.... later all.<P>-The Bastard||||reg||14
Z||000001||Uaana||03-03-2000||02:56 AM||||Nice spank bastard!<BR>Had a similar incident a couple of weeks ago<BR>Couple nimrods in their Late model F150 started doing the rev thing at a red and making rude gestures at my GT.. Belive it or not my GF actually said go for it..  Smoked em' off the line and for about 1/2mi until I hit about 60 and the tranny went to third..<BR>You guessed it they passed me.. But I dusted em on a nice baby twisty that was another mi up the road..||||reg||14
